---
title: UC-10 Подати скаргу на гравця
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    state "Запит отримано" as Req
    state "Скаргу відхилено" as Rejected
    state "Транзакція відкрита" as TxOpen
    state "Пару збережено" as Saved
    state "Лічильник збільшено" as Counted
    state "B позначено flagged" as Flagged
    state "Скаргу прийнято" as Accepted
    state "Скаргу скасовано" as Cancelled

    state SelfCheck <<choice>>
    state DupCheck <<choice>>
    state SaveRes <<choice>>
    state IncRes <<choice>>
    state Fork1 <<fork>>
    state Join1 <<join>>
    state FlagCheck <<choice>>

    [*] --> Req : Player: / send submitReport(reportedPlayerId) → Система

    Req --> SelfCheck : Система: recv submitReport ← Player A<br/>isSelfReport

    SelfCheck --> Rejected : [A = B] SC-043 REP-02<br/>без existsPair
    SelfCheck --> DupCheck : [інакше, A ≠ B]<br/>Система: / send existsPair(A,B) → зв'язок «скаржиться на»

    DupCheck --> Rejected : [existsPair = true] SC-042 REP-02<br/>recv existsPair ← зв'язок
    DupCheck --> TxOpen : [інакше, existsPair = false] SC-040 REP-01<br/>Система: beginTransaction

    TxOpen --> Fork1

    Fork1 --> SaveRes : Система: / send savePair(A,B) → зв'язок «скаржиться на»
    Fork1 --> IncRes : Система: / send incrementReportsCount(B) → Player B

    SaveRes --> Saved : [ok] recv ok ← зв'язок
    SaveRes --> Cancelled : [збій] rollback() SC-041

    IncRes --> Counted : [ok] recv reports_count ← Player B
    IncRes --> Cancelled : [збій] rollback() SC-041

    Saved --> Join1
    Counted --> Join1

    Join1 --> FlagCheck

    FlagCheck --> Flagged : [reports_count ≥ 5] REP-03 SC-044 SC-045<br/>Система: / send setVerificationStatus(B, flagged) → Player B
    FlagCheck --> Accepted : [інакше] REP-03 SC-040<br/>Система: commit

    Flagged --> Accepted : recv ok ← Player B<br/>Система: commit

    Rejected --> [*] : Система: / send reportRejected → Player A<br/>Player: recv reportRejected ← Система<br/>(причина: самоскарга SC-043 / дубль SC-042)
    Accepted --> [*] : Система: / send reportAccepted → Player A<br/>Player: recv reportAccepted ← Система
    Cancelled --> [*] : Система: / send reportFailed → Player A<br/>Player: recv reportFailed ← Система<br/>нічого не застосовано